{
 "title": "MOM, I'M DONE",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "text": "You're thirty-two years old."
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "text": "You're not mentally stable."
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "text": "And you still call your mom to wipe your ass."
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "text": "Today is your wedding day."
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "text": "The church is full. Two hundred guests."
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "text": "Your bride looks beautiful."
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "text": "The priest opens his Bible."
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "text": "And then\u2026 your stomach."
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "text": "You run to the bathroom."
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "text": "You poop."
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "text": "And from the toilet, you yell\u2026"
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "text": "MOM! I'M DONE!",
   "loud": true,
   "yell": true
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "text": "Silence."
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "text": "Then you remember."
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "text": "Mom is outside. Parking the car."
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "text": "The priest closes his Bible."
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "text": "The guests look at the floor."
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "text": "The flower girl drops her flowers."
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "text": "Your father-in-law cracks his knuckles."
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "text": "Grandpa pretends to be asleep."
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "text": "You yell again. Louder."
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "text": "MOM! I'M DOOONE!",
   "loud": true,
   "yell": true
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "text": "What you don't know\u2026"
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "text": "Most kids learn to wipe by age five."
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "text": "You're thirty-two."
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "text": "The bride's family makes a circle."
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "text": "Rock. Paper. Scissors."
